    "title": "Ring Day: A symbol of belonging - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Isabella Garcia ,\n5 hours ago I often romanticized what my undergraduate experience would look like. Impassioned discussions with professors by the fire, meeting classmates and bonding over a shared adoration of Sylvia Plath or Stephen King and trees with actual colors other than a sorry excuse for green. In other words — and with all due respect — not Aggieland. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
